{
  "about": "How a kind moves, how long it lasts loose, and the six base forms (SA-F10, #2882): data the entry tools and the new engine read unchanged. The six base forms are the body's own (content/kinds/body/humanoid.json); a kind writes none of them and may forbid one by name. Carrying and pushing are answered by moveBy(entry, {act, souls}).",
